{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_snakek_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_snakek_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "The Great Bagnapping Adventure",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_snakek_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6ebd353dd04aa2355f01c9c5b3d23bcddab2361a77f4f534211b1335294dd8b6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_b"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm... according to the map, this should be the street market."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow, there's so many stalls, way more than I imagined... Uh oh, I'm starting to worry maybe I didn't bring enough money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow, crystal dumplings! And lotus seed buns! So much tasty food... I'll buy some just to try, they can't cost that much, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Om nom... Burp! I'm so full!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh no! I can't eat anymore! I came to buy gifts for everybody!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh, this is all my fault. I got mad at Cardi when she stepped on my backpack..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't mean to, but my backpack..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I finally made friends with everybody, I can't let it stay like this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll pick a good present, and then apologize to Cardi!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The luster, the pattern, the weight..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No mistaking it, we're gonna be rich this time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph. That Columbian lady just looked at us funny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't be so haughty! If you don't look after your stuff, somebody else will look after it for you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn, daai goh. Barely three words and you scammed that right up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That bitch has no clue what just happened to her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That wasn't no scam, dumbass, I asked permission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We do what we've gotta do to feed ourselves. Is it so wrong to ask Heaven for permission to snatch something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow, you're right! But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it, kiddo? Out with it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I kinda wanna touch that pendant..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here! Over by the window, in the sunlight, the patterns really stand out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wowza, this foreign stuff is way different from what we get in Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? This part... is it supposed to be some kind of beast? There's something on its back—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young man's hand slips and the pendant drops out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_b"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me! I want one of these and one of those!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, alright, girl, let me wrap them up for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't need a bag, I can put them right into my backpack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, I need to pay though... Um, my wallet should be in my jacket pocket."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pendant falls into Cuora's open backpack without anyone noticing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't look like a Lungmenite. Are you here on vacation? Let me give you a discount! Here's your change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're buying a lot. Is it for your parents?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, for my friends!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The girl here has a lot of friends, huh? Here, take some freebies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's all the best Lungmen has to offer, handmade. Share with your friends!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you, mister!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't mention it! I hope you have fun in Lungmen. And uh, keep an eye on your things..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Stall Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There've been a lot of pickpockets around here lately. They especially like targeting foreigners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Got it! Now I know I may not look it, but I'm really good at fighting!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If I see a pickpocket, I'll send him flying!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I never knew the Lungmenites were so friendly! That guy gave me a ton of stuff..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll pick through it all when I get back and hand stuff out to everyone at Rhodes Island!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those little animal figures would be perfect for Adnachiel and Steward..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And that Yanese silk cap would be great for May!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The music box would be good for Lava, and the scarf for Instructor Dobermann..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh, but after going all over the place, I still don't have anything for Cardi."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What can I give her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait a second there, girl!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I dropped something out the window and it landed in that souvenir stall over there. A metal pendant, did you happen to see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? No, I didn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I did. It fell right into your backpack. Would you mind opening it for me so I can take a look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a sec, I'll check..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All the little souvenirs that guy gave me are metal thingies... You didn't come over to bother me just because you saw all that, did you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How dare you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gimme that bag, I'll find it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hand's off! Don't touch my backpack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph! You're trying to steal from me? You'll have to ask my baseball bat first!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half an hour later..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Careless Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good idea, ah goh, I'll start putting it together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't mess it up this time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dammit, that little dumbass is short on success and long on failure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't believe a little girl like that put him on the ground in just a couple of moves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you can't use your fists, you gotta use your brain. Let's change it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_b"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just like the souvenir shop guy said... do I look like such a clueless tourist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I guess Lungmen's got a real problem with crime and safety..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You there, girl, hold up a second!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, don't get the wrong idea. I just heard you talking about how Lungmen isn't safe, so I figured I'd ask what's up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's my badge, these blocks are my beat here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lungmen... Block Manager? What do you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shrewd Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(I've got all kinds of stuff like this prepped and ready. Another badge, another bit of insurance. Let's try this one on for size.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I keep order on the streets and help out the residents."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you encounter something that upset you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've gotten some reports around here of street vendors selling counterfeit goods to tourists at jacked up prices. I'm undercover investigating."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If anything like that happened to you, I might be able to help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well... The vendor guy over there was actually really nice. He gave me a discount and a whole bunch of freebies, actually..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I mean, I bought a whole bunch of stuff, and I don't feel like I spent that much. Definitely feels cheaper than back in Columbia..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, but there was this guy back there who tried to steal my stuff!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? Could you describe his appearance, what he was wearing maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh... he was a man, taller than me, and well... um, I don't really remember what he looked like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's not much to go on. I don't think I'd be able to find him with just this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Never mind. I need to focus on getting a gift for Cardi anyway. Thanks for the offer, Mr. Block Manager. I'd better get going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You need to buy something for your friend? What kind of thing are you looking for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've been working these blocks for years. Maybe I can point you in the right direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not sure how it is in other countries, but us Lungmen Block Managers, we work hard to help our citizens solve problems!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After all, as a Lungmen public servant, I can't let a foreigner leave with the impression that this city isn't safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you've got anything troubling you, ma'am, just let me know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, okay..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, you see... I got into sort of a fight with a friend, and I want to get her an apology gift..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I've been all over the place, and I still haven't found the right gift."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not like I haven't bought anything, it's just nothing I've bought feels right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When you're giving your friend a gift, it's the thought that counts, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've got a short temper and I blow up on my friends sometimes, but when it comes down to it, we're always cool after sharing a meal, a drink, and an apology."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, did you apologize to that friend of yours yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not yet... I mean, it's really hard to know how and when to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you know the kinds of things she likes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Umm... what does Cardi like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think I remember Adnachiel saying that Cardi wants to be a skier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And I saw some ski clothes gathering dust in her room..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then you should get her a gift a skier would like, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um... but I don't know anything about skiing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah, yeah, I get the impression you're more into baseball."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you play? Or just watch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I play! I love baseball!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then why not get her a baseball gift? If it's something you like, that makes a good gift too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um... but I don't think Cardi is into baseball."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I put together a game on the Rhodes Island deck before, but she didn't show..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, speaking of baseball, I just remembered the mall on that block over there has some sort of game where you win prizes playing baseball. Want to check it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you can't think of what to get her, you can just give her whatever prize you win."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A gift won by your own effort has more meaning to it than something you bought, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That makes sense. Lava did say that handmade gifts are better, but I don't have much talent for crafts..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Baseball is what I'm best at, so a prize won in baseball should be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's take a look! It's been a while since I played, and it'll be a nice chance to have some fun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The games are over there. Looks like it's pretty quiet, so head on over!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean the place with the funny machine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Step right up, swing the bat, hit the ball, and win a prize! Today's the last day, hurry on over!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Ugh, that idiot's dressed up as an arcade worker. Looks convincing enough.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Making use of this arcade that just closed, getting the girl to take the bait, it's almost too easy... I really am a genius!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hi there! Is this the place where you play baseball? What are your prizes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, uh... prizes, yeah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow! All that stuff behind the glass there? That's all the prizes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How about that one! Can I get the snowboard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You want the snowboard? Well, that's the grand prize. Pretty tough to win that one..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm, why do I feel like this guy is kinda familiar...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miss, I gotta warn you, no matter how much you saddle up to me, I'm not gonna make the challenge easier for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "See that pitching machine? When you hit the ball back, the scoreboard there will rate you based on where the ball hits."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, if I hit the red center, I get the grand prize?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not that simple! You pay 40 Lungmen Dollars for a round, you get ten balls per round, and if your score is over 475, you get the grand prize."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wanna try?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "475 points means hitting the red center five times, isn't that a bit too hard? Are the other prizes easier to get?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Block Manager?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(What are you doing, why are you making it so hard? Nobody would take a challenge that tough. She'll give up after she fails once!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure, we encourage everyone to try a whole lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you score less than 475, the threshold for the grand prize goes down a bit, to a minimum of 200."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(How good could the girl be? This'll definitely buy enough time.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmmm... Cardi will probably like that snowboard, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now that I think about it, I really wanna see Cardi on the snow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay, let's give it a try, I'll get it in one go. Bring it on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's take your entry fee first, and we'll keep your bag for you in the cabinet back there."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_uptown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's true about Lungmen! We've been walking for ages and only covered two blocks. My feet are dying!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Adnachiel",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's because you keep pulling us into every store, and spend hours picking and choosing without ever actually buying anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's because my wallet is already basically empty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Adnachiel",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, I remember seeing that baseball glove and bat you ordered a couple of days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those are apology gifts for Cuora! And I had to sell some old stuff to make up what I was short..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? Have you and Cuora not yet reconciled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I remember you two quarreling something fierce in the game room... First time I've ever seen Cuora bite a person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thinking back on it... it was my fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can just be too carefree sometimes, assuming everyone's always out to have fun with each other, no joke that can't be made..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Adnachiel",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The medic operators say Cuora's obsession with protecting her backpack is subconscious. Since she's forgotten most of her past, no one knows exactly where it comes from..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's even forgotten her family and friends... Pretty sad, when you think about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But she told me that after making friends at Rhodes Island, she doesn't feel so lonely anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, I haven't seen her since early this morning. Where's she gone off to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh... she's probably still avoiding me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha-yah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh... what? You hit the red zone again? How are you that lucky?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You hit it again?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No... is the difficulty set too low? I think I can adjust the ball direction and blocks here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow! So you can throw out balls that change direction, and put up some more blocks... Hah, alright, I'll get serious too."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew! I feel fantastic. This is the joy of baseball!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Got some more balls? Send them my way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is... is this really happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I maxed out the difficulty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Her stance, her strength, her precision..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is this girl Ambrois Edwards?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, how many points did I get? Did I win the prize?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um... the scoring system is overloaded or something, but just looking at it, you definitely cleared 475..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Shit! Daai goh just left, he can't have found the pendant yet... What do I do? I have to buy him some more time.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then let me get that snowboard!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Err, okay... No, wait! I think you're not quite satisfied yet, miss. Would you like to hit a few more balls?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I already won the prize... I guess I do want to play some more. Do I have to pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, you got the prize, and since nobody else is around, you can keep playing until we close!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ball flies toward Cuora, and in the split second before it passes through the corner of her vision, she swings her bat forcefully—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To the sight of the 'arcade worker' the girl's figure seems to overlap with all the baseball stars he's ever seen."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ball once again nails the center zone. At which point the pitching machine malfunctions, emitting sparks and giving off an uncomfortable sound."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arcade Worker?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What... what's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "BOOM—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_b"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good heavens! I heard that explosion just now, I'm sure we're getting caught up in another incident here now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Adnachiel",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sounds like it came from that mall over there. Say, what's that on the ground...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's Cuora's backpack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh no... is Cuora in danger?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "May",
      "speakerId": "avg_133_mm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Over here! Cuora's here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Cuora! Cuora!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Adnachiel",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's fine, just looks like she's sleeping. Oh? What's that she's holding...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a... snowboard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where... am I? Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I remember... I was playing baseball, and then there was a boom..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What happened next...? Where'd those two guys go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was having so much fun, I didn't get a chance to thank them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But hey, I think Lungmenites are really friendly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh! Yeah! My prize! Where's the snowboard I got for Cardi?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew, it's not broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And my gifts for the others, they're all still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, Cardi..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan and Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan and Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You first, Cuora."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um, okay! This snowboard I won at the mall.. it's for you! I'm sorry about that thing before!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So the snowboard was for me...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard some of the others say you wanted to be a skier..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And I remembered you had some ski clothes, so I thought..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, those clothes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh, well, I kinda ran into a little financial trouble last month and, well... I sold them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, I can get you some new ski clothes next time. Or is there something else you want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmmm... let me think."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cuora",
      "speakerId": "char_150_snakekiller",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure! Just say the word!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cardigan offers a new baseball bat to Cuora, then raises her other hand, waving it in front of the girl.\nIt is covered by a baseball glove."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cardigan",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright... I want you to teach me to play baseball! Starting today!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
